# Bygone Colossus's warp {3} (CR 702.185a): cast for its warp cost, paid exactly with Mana Crypt's {C}{C} and Blasted
# Landscape's {C}, so it holds no colored pip (with only Mana Crypt's {C}{C} the warp cast is not offered, and the pool ends
# empty), it is exiled at the beginning of the next end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mana Crypt
Blasted Landscape
Bygone Colossus
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mana Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Bygone Colossus.Cast(Ability: Warp; Mana: short)
Bot1.Hand.Blasted Landscape.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mana Crypt.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Blasted Landscape.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bygone Colossus.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Mana = 
[Bot1.End]

[Expect]
Exile = Bygone Colossus
Bot1.Battlefield = Blasted Landscape; Mana Crypt
